import ../../../ui/view.dl
import lib/check.dl

set view to a new UI view
set view's width to 640
set view's height to 480
set view's logical width to 1280
set view's logical height to 720
set bounds to the UI viewport bounds in (the address of view)
require condition ((bounds's width = 640.0) and (bounds's height = 480.0)) reporting "An unfitted view used its initial logical size after resizing."
set view's fitted to true
set bounds to the UI viewport bounds in (the address of view)
require condition ((bounds's width = 1280.0) and (bounds's height = 720.0)) reporting "A fitted view used physical units for logical painting."
set view's logical width to 800
set view's logical height to 600
set bounds to the UI viewport bounds in (the address of view)
require condition ((bounds's width = 800.0) and (bounds's height = 600.0)) reporting "An adaptive view retained its preceding viewport."
print line "Shared viewport bounds follow window or fitted coordinates consistently."
